From 30c453509b7edb291ac341f59cbd3ce02ca1b3b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 14:15:42 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Dissolution Chamber and Arcane Library doctrines; one deck
 floor

- One deck floor for running and disenchanting: 10, or 7 under Thin Deck
  (the old T3 "floor 3" only moved the disenchant floor and did nothing)
- Dissolution T3: Thin Deck (floor 7, a 7-card deck draws +1 on turn 1) or
  Transmutation (seeded reroll to another unlocked card of the same school
  and rarity, for its rarity's disenchant value; upgrades refunded)
- Library: research opens at T2 (2 at once), T3 runs 3; T3 Forbidden Archives
  (research in 2 lunations) or Chancery (school card in the opening parley
  hand, Lore valuations start read); dead Persuade text removed
- Dragging a card out of the deck now respects the floor

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RF7HNp6pvyXiAz229q52Px
